Default model (crates/agent-cli, crates/codex-bridge): the refreshed model
catalog (vendor/codex-rs/models-manager/models.json) no longer lists
gpt-5.4 (`visibility: "hide"`, superseded per its own migration note —
"Codex now uses GPT-5.6 Terra in place of GPT-5.4"). Montage now defaults
to gpt-5.6-terra ("Balanced agentic coding model for everyday work",
catalog `default_reasoning_level: "medium"`) at reasoning effort medium,
pinned explicitly by crates/agent-cli/src/main.rs (via `-c model=...` / `-c
